<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Chromecorp mine strike over -- union.</title>
<headline>Chromecorp mine strike over -- union.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A miners' strike at Chromecorp's Chromebronne mine ended on Wednesday, the National Union of Mineworkers said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said management had agreed to reinstate dismissed union leaders. Workers went on strike on Tuesday to protest the dismissal of two union leaders by the mine.</p>
<p>The mine contributes 47,000 tons of saleable product per month to Chromecorp's total 107,000 tons of the product per month.</p>
<p>The mine could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
